# Allowlist: the image needs only package metadata and the source package.
# Everything else (infra/ with Terraform state and tfvars, .env, .git, docs,
# tests, agent config) never enters the build context.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
# uv_build requires the readme declared in pyproject.toml
!README.md
!src/
**/__pycache__
